+# Experiment Scripts for Paper RQ1, RQ2, RQ4, and RQ5
+
+This folder contains only the job scripts needed to rerun the paper experiments for:
+
+- `rq1_reproduction/`: early-stage reproduction (RQ1).
+- `rq2_components/`: component necessity experiments (RQ2).
+- `rq4_model_size/`: model-scale experiments (RQ4).
+- `rq5_diversity/`: item-side diversity experiments (RQ5 / Figure 3).
+
+See the main repository README for setup and artifact-layout requirements. These launchers require data and checkpoints in the submodule layout.
+
+Shared cluster environment settings are kept in `cluster_env.sh` because the job scripts source it directly. Utility Python files used by these scripts are in the top-level `utils/` folder.
+
+The original repository scripts remain in `scripts/`; this folder is the minimal handoff bundle for the paper-specific experiments.
