+# RQ2 Component Necessity Experiments
+
+RQ2 asks whether SIDReasoner's post-reasoning gains are primarily due to the GRPO/RL stage, and whether explicit reasoning is uniformly necessary.
+
+Assumptions before running:
+
+- Environment, data, and base checkpoints are already present.
+- Root evaluator scripts are available: `evaluate_Qwen3_think.py`, `evaluate_Qwen3_strict_no_think.py`, `split.py`, `merge.py`, and `calc.py`.
+- `calc.py` is the modified version that reports the additional exposure metrics, although RQ2 mainly uses HR/NDCG.
+- RA checkpoints are available under `pretrained/Video_Games/sidreasoner_ra_games` and `pretrained/Office_Products/sidreasoner_ra_office`.
+- Released post-RL checkpoints are available under `pretrained/<dataset>/.../actor_merged`.
+
+## 1. Train Non-RL Continuations from RA
+
+This script runs the selected datasets and continuation types.
+
+```bash
+sbatch final_scripts/rq2_components/train_ra_continuations.sh
+```
+
+By default it runs both datasets and both continuation types:
+
+- `extra_sft`: 3 epochs, saves each epoch and exports the lowest-validation-loss model as `final_checkpoint`.
+- `extra_ra`: 10 epochs, keeps the best/final retained checkpoint.
+
+Useful overrides:
+
+```bash
+DATASETS="Video_Games" CONTINUATIONS="extra_sft" sbatch final_scripts/rq2_components/train_ra_continuations.sh
+DATASETS="Office_Products" CONTINUATIONS="extra_ra" sbatch final_scripts/rq2_components/train_ra_continuations.sh
+SCRATCH_OUTPUT_ROOT=./output_dir/continuations sbatch final_scripts/rq2_components/train_ra_continuations.sh
+```
+
+## 2. Evaluate RA, Extra SFT, Extra RA, and RL
+
+```bash
+sbatch final_scripts/rq2_components/evaluate_nonrl_vs_rl.sh
+```
+
+This evaluates the best-validation extra-SFT `final_checkpoint` for the main RQ2 comparison. Per-epoch checkpoints remain available for diagnostics.
+
+Outputs:
+
+- `results/rq2_nonrl_vs_rl/manifest_<jobid>.tsv`
+- `results/rq2_nonrl_vs_rl/summary_<jobid>.md`
+
+## 3. Evaluate Pre-RL Inference Search
+
+```bash
+sbatch final_scripts/rq2_components/evaluate_inference_search.sh
+```
+
